# Checkpoints and optimiser state are reproducible from the committed code +
# frozen caches; they are pulled into the local .rr/ store for analysis and are
# not committed (four 360-epoch states would add ~40 MB to the repository).
results/**/*.pt
results/_smoke/
# Trajectory JSONs inside results/ are ignored repository-wide; the committed
# copies live in analysis/trajectory_<task>_<model>.json.
